SUMMARY:GZA of WU-TANG CLAN performing LIQUID SWORDS in it's entirety
LOCATION:Garden Amphitheatre
DESCRIPTION:GZA is a legendary founding member of the Wu-Tang Clan. Known a
 
s "The Genius\," he is the group's oldest member and is the cousin of fello
 
w founders RZA & Ol' Dirty Bastard. He is widely considered as the group's 
 
"spiritual head" due to his high-level lyricism and seniority. He is celebr
 
ated for his complex metaphors and dense wordplay. Studies have ranked him 
 
among the rappers with the largest vocabularies in the genre. His 1995 solo
 
 album\, Liquid Swords\, is regarded as one of the greatest hip-hop records
 
 of all time\, famous for its dark\, cinematic production and chess-themed 
 
imagery. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/gza-of-wu-tang-cla
 
n-garden-amphitheatre-tickets/15002033
